{
  "version": 1,
  "id": "JwtAuthFlowDsl",
  "title": "JWT 驗證流程",
  "fps": 30,
  "width": 1920,
  "height": 1080,
  "scenes": [
    {
      "id": "intro",
      "beat": "intro",
      "durationInSeconds": 6,
      "narration": "每次登入之後，JWT 讓客戶端帶著一張可驗證的數位通行證，向 API 證明自己的身分。",
      "caption": "登入成功後，伺服器簽發 JWT；之後每次請求都帶著它證明身分。",
      "background": { "variant": "grid", "glow": "success" },
      "content": {
        "type": "stack",
        "grow": true,
        "align": "center",
        "justify": "center",
        "gap": "lg",
        "children": [
          {
            "type": "stack",
            "align": "center",
            "gap": "sm",
            "children": [
              { "type": "pill", "tone": "success", "text": "AUTHENTICATION, EXPLAINED" },
              { "type": "text", "role": "hero", "content": "JWT 驗證流程", "align": "center" },
              { "type": "text", "role": "subtitle", "content": "一張能被伺服器驗證的數位通行證", "align": "center" }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "diagram",
            "width": "wide",
            "fit": "width",
            "graph": {
              "direction": "right",
              "nodes": [
                { "id": "client", "icon": "browser", "label": "Client", "detail": "已登入的使用者", "tone": "info" },
                { "id": "authServer", "icon": "server", "label": "Auth Server", "detail": "簽發 JWT", "tone": "success" }
              ],
              "edges": [{ "from": "client", "to": "authServer", "label": "LOGIN" }]
            },
            "activeNodes": [{ "node": "authServer", "window": { "from": 0.6, "to": 1 } }],
            "reveal": { "window": { "from": 0.23, "to": 0.4 } },
            "flows": [
              {
                "edge": "client->authServer",
                "window": { "from": 0.35, "to": 0.58 },
                "tone": "success",
                "label": "LOGIN"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "stack",
            "width": "half",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "code",
                "size": "sm",
                "reveal": { "window": { "from": 0.6, "to": 0.75 } },
                "lines": [{ "segments": [{ "text": "eyJhbGci...eyJzdWI...SflKxw", "tone": "success" }] }]
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "breakdown",
      "beat": "breakdown",
      "durationInSeconds": 10,
      "narration": "一個 JWT 由 Header、Payload、Signature 三段組成。前兩段只是 Base64URL 編碼，任何人都能讀；真正防止竄改的是簽章。",
      "caption": "Header 和 Payload 任何人都能解碼；Signature 才是防竄改的關鍵。",
      "background": { "variant": "grid", "glow": "syntaxB" },
      "header": { "eyebrow": "01 · Anatomy", "title": "JWT 裡面有什麼？" },
      "content": {
        "type": "stack",
        "align": "center",
        "gap": "lg",
        "children": [
          {
            "type": "stack",
            "width": "wide",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "code",
                "size": "sm",
                "reveal": { "window": { "from": 0.08, "to": 0.2 } },
                "lines": [
                  {
                    "segments": [
                      { "text": "eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9", "tone": "syntaxA" },
                      ".",
                      { "text": "eyJzdWIiOiJ1c2VyXzQyIiwicm9sZSI6ImFkbWluIiwiZXhwIjoxNzg2NTA3MjAwfQ", "tone": "syntaxB" },
                      ".",
                      { "text": "SflKxwRJSMeKKF2QT4fwpMeJf36", "tone": "syntaxC" }
                    ]
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "stack",
            "direction": "row",
            "gap": "lg",
            "width": "full",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "card",
                "tone": "syntaxA",
                "emphasis": "medium",
                "size": "lg",
                "grow": true,
                "window": { "from": 0.18, "to": 0.48 },
                "children": [
                  { "type": "text", "role": "label", "tone": "syntaxA", "content": "01 / HEADER" },
                  {
                    "type": "code",
                    "chrome": "bare",
                    "size": "sm",
                    "lines": [
                      { "segments": ["{"] },
                      { "segments": ["\"alg\": \"HS256\","], "indent": 1 },
                      { "segments": ["\"typ\": \"JWT\""], "indent": 1 },
                      { "segments": ["}"] }
                    ]
                  },
                  { "type": "text", "role": "detail", "content": "演算法與 token 類型" }
                ]
              },
              {
                "type": "card",
                "tone": "syntaxB",
                "emphasis": "medium",
                "size": "lg",
                "grow": true,
                "window": { "from": 0.28, "to": 0.58 },
                "children": [
                  { "type": "text", "role": "label", "tone": "syntaxB", "content": "02 / PAYLOAD" },
                  {
                    "type": "code",
                    "chrome": "bare",
                    "size": "sm",
                    "lines": [
                      { "segments": ["{"] },
                      { "segments": ["\"sub\": \"user_42\","], "indent": 1 },
                      { "segments": ["\"role\": \"admin\","], "indent": 1 },
                      { "segments": ["\"exp\": 1786507200"], "indent": 1 },
                      { "segments": ["}"] }
                    ]
                  },
                  { "type": "text", "role": "detail", "content": "Claims：身分與權限資料" }
                ]
              },
              {
                "type": "card",
                "tone": "syntaxC",
                "emphasis": "medium",
                "size": "lg",
                "grow": true,
                "window": { "from": 0.38, "to": 0.68 },
                "children": [
                  { "type": "text", "role": "label", "tone": "syntaxC", "content": "03 / SIGNATURE" },
                  {
                    "type": "code",
                    "chrome": "bare",
                    "size": "sm",
                    "lines": [
                      { "segments": ["HMACSHA256("] },
                      { "segments": ["base64url(header) + '.' +"], "indent": 1 },
                      { "segments": ["base64url(payload), secret"], "indent": 1 },
                      { "segments": [")"] }
                    ]
                  },
                  { "type": "text", "role": "detail", "content": "證明內容未被竄改" }
                ]
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "pill",
            "tone": "warning",
            "text": "⚠ Payload 是編碼，不是加密",
            "window": { "from": 0.58, "to": 0.65 }
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "walkthrough",
      "beat": "walkthrough",
      "durationInSeconds": 18,
      "narration": "API 收到 Bearer token 後，先重新計算並比對簽章，再檢查有效期限、簽發者和受眾。全部通過，請求才會被授權。",
      "caption": "JWT 不是「解開就相信」：簽章與 claims 必須全部通過，請求才能被授權。",
      "background": { "variant": "grid", "glow": "info" },
      "header": { "eyebrow": "02 · Verification", "title": "API 如何驗證 JWT？" },
      "tracks": [
        {
          "id": "checks",
          "window": { "from": 0.05, "to": 0.98 },
          "items": [
            { "title": "Extract token", "detail": "讀取 Authorization header", "weight": 1 },
            { "title": "Verify signature", "detail": "用可信任的 key 驗章", "weight": 1 },
            { "title": "Validate claims", "detail": "檢查 exp · iss · aud", "weight": 1 },
            { "title": "Authorize", "detail": "套用角色與權限", "weight": 0.6 }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "claims",
          "window": { "track": "checks", "step": 2 },
          "items": [
            { "title": "exp", "detail": "尚未過期" },
            { "title": "iss", "detail": "簽發者正確" },
            { "title": "aud", "detail": "受眾符合" }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "content": {
        "type": "stack",
        "direction": "row",
        "grow": true,
        "gap": "lg",
        "align": "stretch",
        "children": [
          {
            "type": "card",
            "emphasis": "medium",
            "size": "lg",
            "width": "narrow",
            "children": [{ "type": "steps", "track": "checks", "label": "SERVER CHECKLIST" }]
          },
          {
            "type": "switch",
            "track": "checks",
            "cases": [
              {
                "steps": [0, 2],
                "content": {
                  "type": "card",
                  "tone": "info",
                  "emphasis": "medium",
                  "size": "lg",
                  "grow": true,
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "type": "stack",
                      "direction": "row",
                      "justify": "between",
                      "align": "center",
                      "children": [
                        { "type": "text", "role": "label", "content": "GET /api/profile" },
                        { "type": "pill", "tone": "info", "text": "VERIFYING" }
                      ]
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "diagram",
                      "graph": {
                        "direction": "right",
                        "nodes": [
                          { "id": "client", "icon": "browser", "label": "Client", "tone": "syntaxB" },
                          { "id": "apiServer", "icon": "server", "label": "API Server", "tone": "info" }
                        ],
                        "edges": [{ "from": "client", "to": "apiServer" }]
                      },
                      "activeNodes": [{ "node": "apiServer", "window": { "track": "checks", "step": 1 } }],
                      "reveal": { "window": { "from": 0, "to": 0.05 } },
                      "flows": [
                        {
                          "edge": "client->apiServer",
                          "window": { "track": "checks", "step": 0 },
                          "tone": "syntaxB",
                          "label": "Authorization: Bearer JWT"
                        }
                      ]
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "switch",
                      "track": "checks",
                      "cases": [
                        {
                          "steps": [0, 0],
                          "content": {
                            "type": "code",
                            "chrome": "bare",
                            "size": "sm",
                            "lines": [
                              {
                                "segments": [
                                  { "text": "Authorization: ", "tone": "syntaxB" },
                                  "Bearer eyJhbGci...SflKxw"
                                ]
                              }
                            ]
                          }
                        },
                        {
                          "steps": [1, 1],
                          "content": {
                            "type": "stack",
                            "gap": "md",
                            "children": [
                              {
                                "type": "stack",
                                "direction": "row",
                                "align": "center",
                                "gap": "md",
                                "children": [
                                  { "type": "icon", "name": "key", "tone": "syntaxC", "size": "lg" },
                                  {
                                    "type": "stack",
                                    "gap": "sm",
                                    "children": [
                                      { "type": "text", "role": "label", "tone": "syntaxC", "content": "RECOMPUTE SIGNATURE" },
                                      {
                                        "type": "code",
                                        "chrome": "bare",
                                        "size": "sm",
                                        "lines": [
                                          {
                                            "segments": [
                                              "HMACSHA256(base64url(header)+'.'+base64url(payload), secret) === signature"
                                            ]
                                          }
                                        ]
                                      }
                                    ]
                                  }
                                ]
                              },
                              { "type": "meter", "tone": "syntaxC", "window": { "track": "checks", "step": 1 } }
                            ]
                          }
                        },
                        {
                          "steps": [2, 2],
                          "content": { "type": "steps", "track": "claims", "layout": "row" }
                        },
                        {
                          "steps": [3, 3],
                          "content": {
                            "type": "stack",
                            "grow": true,
                            "align": "center",
                            "justify": "center",
                            "children": [
                              {
                                "type": "banner",
                                "tone": "success",
                                "icon": "shield",
                                "text": "Access granted",
                                "detail": "role: admin · scope: profile:read",
                                "window": { "track": "checks", "step": 3 }
                              }
                            ]
                          }
                        }
                      ]
                    }
                  ]
                }
              },
              {
                "steps": [3, 3],
                "content": {
                  "type": "card",
                  "tone": "success",
                  "emphasis": "medium",
                  "size": "lg",
                  "grow": true,
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "type": "stack",
                      "direction": "row",
                      "justify": "between",
                      "align": "center",
                      "children": [
                        { "type": "text", "role": "label", "content": "GET /api/profile" },
                        { "type": "pill", "tone": "success", "text": "200 AUTHORIZED" }
                      ]
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "diagram",
                      "graph": {
                        "direction": "right",
                        "nodes": [
                          { "id": "client", "icon": "browser", "label": "Client", "tone": "syntaxB" },
                          { "id": "apiServer", "icon": "server", "label": "API Server", "tone": "info" }
                        ],
                        "edges": [{ "from": "client", "to": "apiServer" }]
                      },
                      "activeNodes": [{ "node": "apiServer", "window": { "track": "checks", "step": 1 } }],
                      "reveal": { "window": { "from": 0, "to": 0.05 } },
                      "flows": [
                        {
                          "edge": "client->apiServer",
                          "window": { "track": "checks", "step": 0 },
                          "tone": "syntaxB",
                          "label": "Authorization: Bearer JWT"
                        }
                      ]
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "switch",
                      "track": "checks",
                      "cases": [
                        {
                          "steps": [0, 0],
                          "content": {
                            "type": "code",
                            "chrome": "bare",
                            "size": "sm",
                            "lines": [
                              {
                                "segments": [
                                  { "text": "Authorization: ", "tone": "syntaxB" },
                                  "Bearer eyJhbGci...SflKxw"
                                ]
                              }
                            ]
                          }
                        },
                        {
                          "steps": [1, 1],
                          "content": {
                            "type": "stack",
                            "gap": "md",
                            "children": [
                              {
                                "type": "stack",
                                "direction": "row",
                                "align": "center",
                                "gap": "md",
                                "children": [
                                  { "type": "icon", "name": "key", "tone": "syntaxC", "size": "lg" },
                                  {
                                    "type": "stack",
                                    "gap": "sm",
                                    "children": [
                                      { "type": "text", "role": "label", "tone": "syntaxC", "content": "RECOMPUTE SIGNATURE" },
                                      {
                                        "type": "code",
                                        "chrome": "bare",
                                        "size": "sm",
                                        "lines": [
                                          {
                                            "segments": [
                                              "HMACSHA256(base64url(header)+'.'+base64url(payload), secret) === signature"
                                            ]
                                          }
                                        ]
                                      }
                                    ]
                                  }
                                ]
                              },
                              { "type": "meter", "tone": "syntaxC", "window": { "track": "checks", "step": 1 } }
                            ]
                          }
                        },
                        {
                          "steps": [2, 2],
                          "content": { "type": "steps", "track": "claims", "layout": "row" }
                        },
                        {
                          "steps": [3, 3],
                          "content": {
                            "type": "stack",
                            "grow": true,
                            "align": "center",
                            "justify": "center",
                            "children": [
                              {
                                "type": "banner",
                                "tone": "success",
                                "icon": "shield",
                                "text": "Access granted",
                                "detail": "role: admin · scope: profile:read",
                                "window": { "track": "checks", "step": 3 }
                              }
                            ]
                          }
                        }
                      ]
                    }
                  ]
                }
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "summary",
      "beat": "summary",
      "durationInSeconds": 6,
      "narration": "記住三件事：永遠驗證簽章、完整檢查 claims，而且不要把敏感資料放進 payload。JWT 證明完整性，不負責保密。",
      "caption": null,
      "background": { "variant": "grid", "glow": "success" },
      "header": { "eyebrow": "THE TAKEAWAY", "title": "驗證完整性，不是隱藏內容", "tone": "success", "scale": "hero" },
      "content": {
        "type": "stack",
        "grow": true,
        "justify": "center",
        "gap": "xl",
        "children": [
          {
            "type": "stack",
            "direction": "row",
            "align": "center",
            "gap": "lg",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "card",
                "tone": "success",
                "emphasis": "medium",
                "size": "lg",
                "grow": true,
                "window": { "from": 0.13, "to": 0.38 },
                "children": [
                  {
                    "type": "stack",
                    "direction": "row",
                    "justify": "between",
                    "align": "center",
                    "children": [
                      { "type": "text", "role": "label", "tone": "success", "content": "01" },
                      { "type": "icon", "name": "key", "tone": "success" }
                    ]
                  },
                  { "type": "text", "role": "body", "content": "Verify signature" },
                  { "type": "text", "role": "detail", "content": "只信任你允許的演算法與 key" }
                ]
              },
              {
                "type": "card",
                "tone": "success",
                "emphasis": "medium",
                "size": "lg",
                "grow": true,
                "window": { "from": 0.21, "to": 0.46 },
                "children": [
                  {
                    "type": "stack",
                    "direction": "row",
                    "justify": "between",
                    "align": "center",
                    "children": [
                      { "type": "text", "role": "label", "tone": "success", "content": "02" },
                      { "type": "icon", "name": "shield", "tone": "success" }
                    ]
                  },
                  { "type": "text", "role": "body", "content": "Validate claims" },
                  { "type": "text", "role": "detail", "content": "檢查 exp、iss、aud 與權限" }
                ]
              },
              {
                "type": "card",
                "tone": "warning",
                "emphasis": "medium",
                "size": "lg",
                "grow": true,
                "window": { "from": 0.29, "to": 0.54 },
                "children": [
                  {
                    "type": "stack",
                    "direction": "row",
                    "justify": "between",
                    "align": "center",
                    "children": [
                      { "type": "text", "role": "label", "tone": "warning", "content": "03" },
                      { "type": "icon", "name": "user", "tone": "warning" }
                    ]
                  },
                  { "type": "text", "role": "body", "content": "Payload is public" },
                  { "type": "text", "role": "detail", "content": "不要放密碼或任何敏感資料" }
                ]
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "stack",
            "direction": "row",
            "align": "center",
            "justify": "center",
            "gap": "md",
            "window": { "from": 0.6, "to": 1 },
            "children": [
              { "type": "icon", "name": "shield", "tone": "info", "size": "sm" },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "role": "detail",
                "content": [{ "text": "Sign · Verify · Authorize", "strong": true }, " — 這就是 JWT 的信任鏈"]
